<title>USA: Schroder Asian Growth sets selftender.</title>
<headline>Schroder Asian Growth sets selftender.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Asian Growth Fund Inc said on Wednesday it has commenced a tender offer for 3,500,000 shares of its common stock, or 17.85 percent of the fund's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The tender offer will expire at 1700 EST/2200 GMT on March 20, 1997, unless extended, the fund said.</p>
<p>The fund, with current net assets of approximately $267 million, invests primarily in equity securities of Asian companies.</p>
<p>The repurchase price will be the fund's net asset value per share as of March 21, 1997, a spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
